  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>This is a list of all the <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">missions</a> and primary quests in <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Factions\" title=\"Guild Wars Factions\">Guild Wars Factions</a>, taking you through the <a href=\"/wiki/Storyline\" title=\"Storyline\">storyline</a>, as well as the <a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Mission\" title=\"Challenge Mission\">challenge Missions</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Competitive_Mission\" title=\"Competitive Mission\">Competitive Missions</a>. Characters from non-Factions campaigns who travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Cantha</a> will join the storyline at <a href=\"/wiki/Bejunkan_Pier\" title=\"Bejunkan Pier\">Bejunkan Pier</a> with the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_to_Cantha\" title=\"Welcome to Cantha\">Welcome to Cantha</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Storyline_Missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Storyline Missions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Shing_Jea_Island\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Shing Jea Island</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Kaineng_City\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Kaineng City</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Echovald_Forest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Echovald Forest</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#The_Jade_Sea\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Jade Sea</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Kaineng_City_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Kaineng City</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Echovald_Forest_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Echovald Forest</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#The_Jade_Sea_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Jade Sea</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Kaineng_City_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Kaineng City</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Challenge_Missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge Missions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Competitive_Missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Competitive Missions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Elite_Missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elite Missions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Storyline_Missions\">Storyline Missions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Storyline Missions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Shing_Jea_Island\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shing_Jea_Island\" title=\"Shing Jea Island\">Shing Jea Island</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Shing Jea Island\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The first quest offered to a new character is the tutorial <a href=\"/wiki/Mantid_Hatchlings\" title=\"Mantid Hatchlings\">Mantid Hatchlings</a>. For players already familiar with the game, you can skip the tutorial completely. Depending on the profession of your character, the chain of quests to be completed will be:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Zhan\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Zhan\">Seek Out Headmaster Zhan</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Talon_Silverwing\" title=\"Locate Talon Silverwing\">Locate Talon Silverwing</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Talon%27s_Duel\" title=\"Talon&#39;s Duel\">Talon's Duel</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Weng_Gha\" title=\"Track Down Weng Gha\">Track Down Weng Gha</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Crop_Thieves\" title=\"The Crop Thieves\">The Crop Thieves</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(warrior)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (warrior)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Greico\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Greico\">Seek Out Headmaster Greico</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Sujun\" title=\"Locate Sujun\">Locate Sujun</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Free_the_Fur\" title=\"Free the Fur\">Free the Fur</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Zho\" title=\"Track Down Zho\">Track Down Zho</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Yeti_Hunt\" title=\"The Yeti Hunt\">The Yeti Hunt</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(ranger)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (ranger)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Amara\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Amara\">Seek Out Headmaster Amara</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Sister_Tai\" title=\"Locate Sister Tai\">Locate Sister Tai</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Stale_Mate\" title=\"Stale Mate\">Stale Mate</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Brother_Pe_Wan\" title=\"Track Down Brother Pe Wan\">Track Down Brother Pe Wan</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Seeking_a_Cure\" title=\"Seeking a Cure\">Seeking a Cure</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(monk)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (monk)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Kuju\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Kuju\">Seek Out Headmaster Kuju</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Reng_Ku\" title=\"Locate Reng Ku\">Locate Reng Ku</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Little_Creatures\" title=\"Little Creatures\">Little Creatures</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Su\" title=\"Track Down Su\">Track Down Su</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Reaping_the_Naga\" title=\"Reaping the Naga\">Reaping the Naga</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(necromancer)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (necromancer)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Kaa\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Kaa\">Seek Out Headmaster Kaa</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Mei_Ling\" title=\"Locate Mei Ling\">Locate Mei Ling</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Cleansing_the_Shrine\" title=\"Cleansing the Shrine\">Cleansing the Shrine</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Lo_Sha\" title=\"Track Down Lo Sha\">Track Down Lo Sha</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Lo_Sha%27s_Gift\" title=\"Lo Sha&#39;s Gift\">Lo Sha's Gift</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(mesmer)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (mesmer)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Vhang\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Vhang\">Seek Out Headmaster Vhang</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Ronsu\" title=\"Locate Ronsu\">Locate Ronsu</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Spark_of_Interest\" title=\"Spark of Interest\">Spark of Interest</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Kai_Ying\" title=\"Track Down Kai Ying\">Track Down Kai Ying</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Sparring_Elements\" title=\"Sparring Elements\">Sparring Elements</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(elementalist)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (elementalist)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Lee\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Lee\">Seek Out Headmaster Lee</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Jinzo\" title=\"Locate Jinzo\">Locate Jinzo</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Opening_Strike\" title=\"Opening Strike\">Opening Strike</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Panaku\" title=\"Track Down Panaku\">Track Down Panaku</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Strike\" title=\"Dual Strike\">Dual Strike</a>  &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(assassin)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (assassin)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Seek_Out_Headmaster_Quin\" title=\"Seek Out Headmaster Quin\">Seek Out Headmaster Quin</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Professor_Gai\" title=\"Locate Professor Gai\">Locate Professor Gai</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Minions_Gone_Wild\" title=\"Minions Gone Wild\">Minions Gone Wild</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Ang_the_Ephemeral\" title=\"Track Down Ang the Ephemeral\">Track Down Ang the Ephemeral</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Shackled_Spirits\" title=\"Shackled Spirits\">Shackled Spirits</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(ritualist)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (ritualist)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p>If you have not yet chosen a <a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">secondary profession</a>, Master Togo will allow you to take the quest to choose one now. Depending on what secondary profession you wish to choose, the quest chain will be: \n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Zhan_(Warrior)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Zhan (Warrior)\">Speak with Headmaster Zhan (Warrior)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Talon_Silverwing\" title=\"Locate Talon Silverwing\">Locate Talon Silverwing</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Talon%27s_Duel\" title=\"Talon&#39;s Duel\">Talon's Duel</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Weng_Gha\" title=\"Track Down Weng Gha\">Track Down Weng Gha</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Crop_Thieves\" title=\"The Crop Thieves\">The Crop Thieves</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(warrior)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (warrior)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Greico_(Ranger)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Greico (Ranger)\">Speak with Headmaster Greico (Ranger)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Sujun\" title=\"Locate Sujun\">Locate Sujun</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Free_the_Fur\" title=\"Free the Fur\">Free the Fur</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Zho\" title=\"Track Down Zho\">Track Down Zho</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Yeti_Hunt\" title=\"The Yeti Hunt\">The Yeti Hunt</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(ranger)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (ranger)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Amara_(Monk)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Amara (Monk)\">Speak with Headmaster Amara (Monk)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Sister_Tai\" title=\"Locate Sister Tai\">Locate Sister Tai</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Stale_Mate\" title=\"Stale Mate\">Stale Mate</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Brother_Pe_Wan\" title=\"Track Down Brother Pe Wan\">Track Down Brother Pe Wan</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Seeking_a_Cure\" title=\"Seeking a Cure\">Seeking a Cure</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(monk)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (monk)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Kuju_(Necromancer)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Kuju (Necromancer)\">Speak with Headmaster Kuju (Necromancer)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Reng_Ku\" title=\"Locate Reng Ku\">Locate Reng Ku</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Little_Creatures\" title=\"Little Creatures\">Little Creatures</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Su\" title=\"Track Down Su\">Track Down Su</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Reaping_the_Naga\" title=\"Reaping the Naga\">Reaping the Naga</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(necromancer)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (necromancer)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Kaa_(Mesmer)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Kaa (Mesmer)\">Speak with Headmaster Kaa (Mesmer)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Mei_Ling\" title=\"Locate Mei Ling\">Locate Mei Ling</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Cleansing_the_Shrine\" title=\"Cleansing the Shrine\">Cleansing the Shrine</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Lo_Sha\" title=\"Track Down Lo Sha\">Track Down Lo Sha</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Lo_Sha%27s_Gift\" title=\"Lo Sha&#39;s Gift\">Lo Sha's Gift</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(mesmer)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (mesmer)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Vhang_(Elementalist)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Vhang (Elementalist)\">Speak with Headmaster Vhang (Elementalist)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Ronsu\" title=\"Locate Ronsu\">Locate Ronsu</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Spark_of_Interest\" title=\"Spark of Interest\">Spark of Interest</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Kai_Ying\" title=\"Track Down Kai Ying\">Track Down Kai Ying</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Sparring_Elements\" title=\"Sparring Elements\">Sparring Elements</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(elementalist)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (elementalist)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Lee_(Assassin)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Lee (Assassin)\">Speak with Headmaster Lee (Assassin)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Jinzo\" title=\"Locate Jinzo\">Locate Jinzo</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Opening_Strike\" title=\"Opening Strike\">Opening Strike</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Panaku\" title=\"Track Down Panaku\">Track Down Panaku</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Strike\" title=\"Dual Strike\">Dual Strike</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(assassin)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (assassin)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Headmaster_Quin_(Ritualist)\" title=\"Speak with Headmaster Quin (Ritualist)\">Speak with Headmaster Quin (Ritualist)</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Locate_Professor_Gai\" title=\"Locate Professor Gai\">Locate Professor Gai</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Minions_Gone_Wild\" title=\"Minions Gone Wild\">Minions Gone Wild</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Ang_the_Ephemeral\" title=\"Track Down Ang the Ephemeral\">Track Down Ang the Ephemeral</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Shackled_Spirits\" title=\"Shackled Spirits\">Shackled Spirits</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/An_Audience_with_Master_Togo_(ritualist)\" title=\"An Audience with Master Togo (ritualist)\">An Audience with Master Togo</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>Note: You can take all the secondary <a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">profession</a> quests, this is highly recommended as you will gain much more experience. When you have already finished one of the eight secondary profession quest chains above, Master Togo will offer you an additional quest, which will effectively finalize your secondary profession choice.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Choose_Your_Secondary_Profession_(Factions)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Choose Your Secondary Profession (Factions)\">Choose Your Secondary Profession</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/A_Formal_Introduction\" title=\"A Formal Introduction\">A Formal Introduction</a></dd>\n<dt>1. <a href=\"/wiki/Minister_Cho%27s_Estate\" title=\"Minister Cho&#39;s Estate\">Minister Cho's Estate</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Warning_the_Tengu\" title=\"Warning the Tengu\">Warning the Tengu</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Threat_Grows\" title=\"The Threat Grows\">The Threat Grows</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Journey_to_the_Master\" title=\"Journey to the Master\">Journey to the Master</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Road_Less_Traveled\" title=\"The Road Less Traveled\">The Road Less Traveled</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Looking_For_Trouble\" title=\"Looking For Trouble\">Looking For Trouble</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/To_the_Rescue_(Factions_quest)\" title=\"To the Rescue (Factions quest)\">To the Rescue</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/To_Zen_Daijun\" title=\"To Zen Daijun\">To Zen Daijun</a></dd>\n<dt>2. <a href=\"/wiki/Zen_Daijun\" title=\"Zen Daijun\">Zen Daijun</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/A_Master%27s_Burden\" title=\"A Master&#39;s Burden\">A Master's Burden</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Kaineng_City\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kaineng_City\" title=\"Kaineng City\">Kaineng City</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Kaineng City\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Mayhem_in_the_Market\" title=\"Mayhem in the Market\">Mayhem in the Market</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><i>This is where non-Factions characters will join in the storyline, with the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_to_Cantha\" title=\"Welcome to Cantha\">Welcome to Cantha</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>3. <a href=\"/wiki/Vizunah_Square\" title=\"Vizunah Square\">Vizunah Square</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Finding_The_Oracle\" title=\"Finding The Oracle\">Finding The Oracle</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Closer_to_the_Stars\" title=\"Closer to the Stars\">Closer to the Stars</a></dd>\n<dt>4. <a href=\"/wiki/Nahpui_Quarter\" title=\"Nahpui Quarter\">Nahpui Quarter</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/To_Tahnnakai_Temple\" title=\"To Tahnnakai Temple\">To Tahnnakai Temple</a></dd>\n<dt>5. <a href=\"/wiki/Tahnnakai_Temple\" title=\"Tahnnakai Temple\">Tahnnakai Temple</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/A_Meeting_With_the_Emperor\" title=\"A Meeting With the Emperor\">A Meeting With the Emperor</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Count%27s_Daughter\" title=\"The Count&#39;s Daughter\">The Count's Daughter</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Echovald_Forest\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echovald_Forest\" title=\"Echovald Forest\">Echovald Forest</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Echovald Forest\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>6. <a href=\"/wiki/Arborstone\" title=\"Arborstone\">Arborstone</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/The_Convocation\" title=\"The Convocation\">The Convocation</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Jade_Sea\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Jade_Sea\" title=\"The Jade Sea\">The Jade Sea</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: The Jade Sea\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>7. <a href=\"/wiki/Boreas_Seabed\" title=\"Boreas Seabed\">Boreas Seabed</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/City_Under_Attack\" title=\"City Under Attack\">City Under Attack</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_in_the_Sewers\" title=\"Battle in the Sewers\">Battle in the Sewers</a></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Kaineng_City_2\">Kaineng City</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Kaineng City\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>8. <a href=\"/wiki/Sunjiang_District\" title=\"Sunjiang District\">Sunjiang District</a></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>After the completion of Sunjiang District, the players will find themselves in <a href=\"/wiki/Maatu_Keep\" title=\"Maatu Keep\">Maatu Keep</a>. The storyline here forks in two different paths; the Kurzick one leads through the Echovald Forest, and the Luxon path takes the player to the Jade Sea. Note that these are <b>not</b> mutually exclusive, both can be completed, but only one is needed to continue the storyline. The storyline rejoins after the completion of the <a href=\"/wiki/Unwaking_Waters\" title=\"Unwaking Waters\">Unwaking Waters</a> mission, with the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Taking_Back_the_Palace\" title=\"Taking Back the Palace\">Taking Back the Palace</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Echovald_Forest_2\">Echovald Forest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Echovald Forest\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Journey_to_House_zu_Heltzer\" title=\"Journey to House zu Heltzer\">Journey to House zu Heltzer</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Befriending_the_Kurzicks\" title=\"Befriending the Kurzicks\">Befriending the Kurzicks</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Defenders_of_the_Forest\" title=\"The Defenders of the Forest\">The Defenders of the Forest</a></dd>\n<dt>9a. <a href=\"/wiki/The_Eternal_Grove\" title=\"The Eternal Grove\">The Eternal Grove</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Into_the_Whirlpool\" title=\"Into the Whirlpool\">Into the Whirlpool</a></dd>\n<dt>10a. <a href=\"/wiki/Unwaking_Waters\" title=\"Unwaking Waters\">Unwaking Waters</a></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Jade_Sea_2\">The Jade Sea</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: The Jade Sea\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Journey_to_Cavalon\" title=\"Journey to Cavalon\">Journey to Cavalon</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Befriending_the_Luxons\" title=\"Befriending the Luxons\">Befriending the Luxons</a> &#8594; <a href=\"/wiki/Stolen_Eggs\" title=\"Stolen Eggs\">Stolen Eggs</a></dd>\n<dt>9b. <a href=\"/wiki/Gyala_Hatchery\" title=\"Gyala Hatchery\">Gyala Hatchery</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Journey_to_the_Whirlpool\" title=\"Journey to the Whirlpool\">Journey to the Whirlpool</a></dd>\n<dt>10b. <a href=\"/wiki/Unwaking_Waters\" title=\"Unwaking Waters\">Unwaking Waters</a></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><i>The two different paths of the storyline rejoin here, with the quest:</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/Taking_Back_the_Palace\" title=\"Taking Back the Palace\">Taking Back the Palace</a>.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Kaineng_City_3\">Kaineng City</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=List_of_Factions_missions_and_primary_quests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Kaineng City\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>11. <a href=\"/wiki/Raisu_Palace\" title=\"Raisu Palace\">Raisu Palace</a></dt>\n<dt>12. <a href=\"/wiki/Imperial_Sanctum\" title=\"Imperial Sanctum\">Imperial Sanctum</a></dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge_Missions\">Challenge Missions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsec